lookout-deepstream Week 1 scaffold
==================================

Install root
------------
- /opt/lookout/deepstream/

Service intent
--------------
- Unit scaffold: lookout-deepstream.service
- Week 1 uses a placeholder launcher script to document expected service wiring.

Dependency strategy
-------------------
- This package expects NVIDIA L4T/JetPack/DeepStream runtime dependencies
  to be provided by the base image or dependency packages.
- Maintainer scripts do not compile CUDA/TensorRT artifacts.

Config strategy
---------------
- Runtime config should be sourced from /etc/lookout/ for device-specific
  overrides in later phases.
